 "description": "A snack vending machine (an AMS 39 is 1.83 x 0.99 x 0.89 m): a cabinet with an open, lit interior, product trays with wire spirals and packets in six colours behind the glass, a front door hinged on its left edge (-x) holding the glass, a lit header sign, the payment column with display, 12-key keypad, coin slot, bill acceptor, card reader, coin return and T-handle lock, and a delivery bin with a push flap hinged on its top edge. Faces +Z, stands on four levelling feet on y = 0.",
